{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26020","headline":"春日言怀 · 鲍溶","name":"春日言怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湛湛琴前酒，期自赏青春。\n胡爲缄笑语，深念不思身。\n寂寂花舞多，嘤嘤鸟言频。\n心悲兄弟远，愿见相似人。\n江界田土卑，竞来东作勤。\n岁寒虚尽力，家外无强亲。\n杳窅青云望，无途同苦辛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}